    "spec": "When a new owner is not a hard duplicate but shares an existing owner's lastName and postcode with a different telephone, still create it and return 'possibleDuplicate' true with 'possibleDuplicateOf' set to the matching owner id; otherwise 'possibleDuplicate' false.",
    "prompt": "Implement the following change to the application so that it fully satisfies\nthe specification and all existing and new tests pass. Run the test suite and\nmake it green before finishing.\n\nWhen a new owner is not a hard duplicate but shares an existing owner's lastName and postcode with a different telephone, still create it and return 'possibleDuplicate' true with 'possibleDuplicateOf' set to the matching owner id; otherwise 'possibleDuplicate' false.\n"
